The Velocity rendering engine has been removed from the CMS. Constructs using one of the part types
* Velocity
* Breadcrumb
* Navigation

must be migrated to using Handlebars before updating the CMS.

If the migration from Velocity to Handlebars cannot be completed in advance, Velocity can be added back as a custom component.
Please contact our Sales team at sales@gentics.com to discuss this option.
